      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We describe 2 patients with pseudoxanthoma elasticum (PXE) and angioid streaks. In one patient PXE was complicated by cardiovascular disease. The other patient presented with acute visual decline in one eye after a minor blunt injury. Information about PXE and its complications is given."},
